{"id":"3ef6e0e94ba3d16e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-prop-continuum-regularity.md","title":"Continuum Regularity","display":"prop-continuum-regularity — Continuum Regularity","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-continuum-regularity","aliases":["58-prop-continuum-regularity"],"display":"prop-continuum-regularity — Continuum Regularity","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-continuum-regularity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-continuum-regularity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-continuum-regularity — Continuum Regularity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e4b11a70b933099\" href=\"?note=5e4b11a70b933099\" title=\"../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md\">../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|=2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(2^\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(2^\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\\)</span> for every infinite cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e4b11a70b933099\" href=\"?note=5e4b11a70b933099\" title=\"../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md\">../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}regularity} \\vdash \\mathrm{cf}(\\mathfrak c)&gt;\\aleph_0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}continuum\\text{-}regularity} \\vdash \\mathrm{cf}(\\mathfrak c)&gt;\\aleph_0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The continuum can be singular or regular in ZFC.</li>\n<li>Consistency of a singular continuum requires explicit consistency-strength hypotheses and is not encoded as an unqualified ZFC consequence here.</li>\n<li>This is a key result in cardinal arithmetic.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · de